{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q30314945","formula":"C₁₀H₁₂FeN₂NaO₈","hill":"C10H12FeN2NaO8","elements":["H","C","N","O","Na","Fe"],"composition":{"C":10.0,"H":12.0,"N":2.0,"O":8.0,"Fe":1.0,"Na":1.0},"names":{"en":"Ferric sodium EDTA","ru":"Железная соль Трилона Б"},"descriptions":{"en":"Ferric sodium EDTA, also known as sodium ferric ethylenediaminetetraacetate, is a broad spectrum molluscicide used to kill snails and slugs and protect agricultural crops and garden plants, and in particular to eliminate infestations of Cornu aspersum, the common garden snail. Chemically, it is a salt of ethylenediaminetetraacetic acid (EDTA).","ru":"Желе́зная соль трило́на Б (этилендиаминтетрауксусной кислоты железо (III) мононатриевая соль, трилона Б железный комплекс) — органическое соединение, хелатный комплекс трёхвалентного железа и трилона Б c химической формулой C10H12FeN2NaO8. Используется в цветной фотографии как отбеливатель и как моллюскоцид в сельском хозяйстве и садоводстве."},"fame":5,"pubchemCid":27461,"mass":367.05,"charge":0,"smiles":"C(CN(CC(=O)[O-])CC(=O)[O-])N(CC(=O)[O-])CC(=O)[O-].[Na+].[Fe+3]","inchikey":"MKWYFZFMAMBPQK-UHFFFAOYSA-J","iupac":"sodium;2-[2-[bis(carboxylatomethyl)amino]ethyl-(carboxylatomethyl)amino]acetate;iron(3+)","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"27461","atoms":34,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.948,"y":-0.006,"z":-0.52,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.253,"y":0.198,"z":0.469,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.609,"y":0.187,"z":-0.153,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.626,"y":0.844,"z":0.725,"el":"C"},{"x":-3.988,"y":1.261,"z":0.052,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.06,"y":1.386,"z":-1.207,"el":"O"},{"x":-4.925,"y":1.519,"z":0.887,"el":"O"},{"x":-2.046,"y":-1.161,"z":-0.629,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.259,"y":-2.336,"z":0.392,"el":"C"},{"x":-2.158,"y":-2.133,"z":1.636,"el":"O"}